  "description": "* (Disclaimer: The content in this video is intended for educational and informational purposes only)\nToledo, Ohio — On May 17, 2026, Toledo Police officers responded to a weapons call in the 3400 block of Coral Avenue. The caller reported that a male suspect was loading a shotgun while making threatening statements, including threats to kill multiple people. Upon arrival, officers located the suspect, later identified as 44-year-old Brandon Pechette, who was armed with a shotgun. Officers issued numerous verbal commands for the suspect to drop the weapon but he pointed it at police. During the encounter, officers discharged their weapons, striking the suspect. The suspect was taken into custody at the scene, and the weapon was secured. Toledo Fire and Rescue responded and transported the suspect to an area hospital with non-life-threatening injuries. No officers were injured during the incident. Court records show Pechette is facing a first-degree felony charge for felonious assault with a weapon.\n\n🚨𝑇ℎ𝑖𝑠 𝑐ℎ𝑎𝑛𝑛𝑒𝑙 𝑝𝑟𝑜𝑣𝑖𝑑𝑒𝑠 𝑐𝑜𝑛𝑡𝑒𝑥𝑡𝑢𝑎𝑙 𝑑𝑜𝑐𝑢𝑚𝑒𝑛𝑡𝑎𝑡𝑖𝑜𝑛 𝑎𝑛𝑑 𝑎𝑛𝑎𝑙𝑦𝑠𝑖𝑠 𝑜𝑓 𝑟𝑒𝑎𝑙 𝑝𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑐𝑒 𝑖𝑛𝑐𝑖𝑑𝑒𝑛𝑡𝑠 𝑢𝑠𝑖𝑛𝑔 𝑝𝑢𝑏𝑙𝑖𝑐𝑙𝑦 𝑎𝑣𝑎𝑖𝑙𝑎𝑏𝑙𝑒 𝑟𝑒𝑐𝑜𝑟𝑑𝑠.\n\n⚠️𝑉𝑖𝑒𝑤𝑒𝑟 𝑑𝑖𝑠𝑐𝑟𝑒𝑡𝑖𝑜𝑛 𝑖𝑠 𝑎𝑑𝑣𝑖𝑠𝑒𝑑 𝑑𝑢𝑒 𝑡𝑜 𝑡ℎ𝑒 𝑠𝑒𝑟𝑖𝑜𝑢𝑠 𝑛𝑎𝑡𝑢𝑟𝑒 𝑜𝑓 𝑡ℎ𝑒 𝑐𝑜𝑛𝑡𝑒𝑛𝑡.⚠️\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nSpecial thanks to Shout-Out Supporters on Patreon:\n- 'DIY Solar Power with Will Prowse'\n- Michael Griffin\n- John Doe\n- 'Twitchypowpow'\n- Lillian Daley\n- Tyrell Robertson\n- christine Grinter\n- 'Based Asuka'\n- 'The Evil Queen'\n- Benjamin Osgood\n- Gary Wilson\n- LJ\n- Edward Aquino\n- Brianna Wilkins\n- William\n- Cammy\n- Elisabeth Craig\n- Bobby Roach\n- Sarin Dipity\n- Becky Hopkins\n- thomas\n- Cody Stephens\n- Troy Polansky\n- Tulla Belle\n- 'quadrakyiro'\n- Scott Mackin\n- \"John B. GunsSaveLife\"\n- david wallace\n- Brice Danos\n- 'PhlyDaily'\n- RayJayOB\n- Josef Rex\n- 'Jun'\n- 'Xenik'\n- 'GotsNoGroove Cheryl'\n- Kelly Goodwin\n- 'Dawesenm'\n- Paul Rohrbaugh\n- 'AccuShoot.com'\n- Lisa Overly\n- Gerardo Flores\n- 'coco Coco'\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐